                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is silly and absurd, but surprisingly difficult at times. \nBut even in repeat playthroughs, you'll have fun. \nIt helps the events are random, so each run will be different. Even similar events (like bandits shooting at you) have variations (like the bandits now being able to aim at you).\n\nYou'll unlock different wagons with different stats and base weapon (some will be easier, some will be effectively extra hard mode), and different choices of path, each with its own random events. the game will be different each time.\n\nAnd of course the best part, is the comical and absurd story beats. Find a unicorn? Possible. Fly into space? Yep, possible. Make the game \"crash\"? Oh yeah. Encounter a dinosaur? You bet. \nAnd dozens or more of other insane events.\n\nOverall, even at its full price of $3, it's well worth it, in my opinion.",
